# Enclosure LLM Guide

## Agent Operating Loop

1. If `.enclosure/` is missing, run `enclosure workspace sync init`.
2. Run `enclosure --llm`, then `enclosure workspace rules route --task calibration`.
3. Read `.enclosure/enclosure.yaml`, `.enclosure/rules/INDEX.md`, and route files.
4. Confirm files read, reason, stop point, checks, and post-change `enclosure health`.
5. Before shaped files, use `enclosure workspace recipe --list`, `enclosure workspace recipe <name> --show`, and `enclosure workspace recipe <name> <path> --shell`.
6. Use `enclosure health`, then local health for drilldown.
7. Use `enclosure workspace rules`, `enclosure workspace recipe --check`, `enclosure architecture boundaries`, and `enclosure architecture shape` as focused checks.
8. After changes, rerun health and focused checks.

## Automation Loop

For CI, review, or handoff run `enclosure workspace rules`, `enclosure workspace recipe --check`, then `enclosure health`; stop on first failure.

## Flexibility

- `architecture.root`, `exclusions`, `shape`, `boundaries`, and `flow` define checks.
- `workspace.rules.local` and `workspace.guidance` tune limits.
